 = 8\\)\n   - **Millions place:** \\(6 + 4 = 10\\) (Write down 0, carry over 1)\n   - **Ten-millions place:** \\(5 + 7 + 1 = 13\\) (Write down 3, carry over 1)\n   - **Hundred-millions place:** \\(4 + 7 + 1 = 12\\) (Write down 2, carry over 1)\n   - **Billions place:** \\(1\\) (Carried over)\n\n3. **Combine all the results:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\begin{array}{r}\n     \\phantom{0}456,\\!732,\\!983 \\\\\n   + 744,\\!469,\\!321 \\\\\n   \\hline\n   1,\\!199,\\!202,\\!304 \\\\\n   \\end{array}\n   \\]\n\n# Answer:\nTherefore, the final computed sum is \\(\\boxed{1,\\!199,\\!202,\\!304}\\).. Therefore, the answer is"]]
