 place:**  .\n     \\(7 + 3 = 10\\)  .\n     Write down **0** and carry over **1**.\n\n   - **Tens place:**  .\n     \\(6 + 7 + 1 = 14\\)  .\n     Write down **4** and carry over **1**.\n\n   - **Hundreds place:**  .\n     \\(4 + 8 + 1 = 13\\)  .\n     Write down **3** and carry over **1**.\n\n   - **Thousands place:**  .\n     \\(3 + 0 + 1 = 4\\)  .\n     Write down **4**.\n\n   - **Ten thousands place:**  .\n     \\(6 + 1 = 7\\)  .\n     Write down **7**.\n\n   - **Hundred thousands place:**  .\n     \\(2 + 7 = 9\\)  .\n     Write down **9**.\n\n   - **Millions place:**  .\n     \\(3 + 6 = 9\\)  .\n     Write down **9**.\n\n   - **Ten millions place:**  .\n     \\(1 + 7 = 8\\)  .\n     Write down **8**.\n\n   - **Hundred millions place:**  .\n     \\(4 + 0 = 4\\)  .\n     Write down **4**.\n\n3. **Combine all the results:**.\n\n   ```.\n     412,336,467.\n   + 776,108,773.\n   -------------. Therefore, the answer is"]]
