 place values:**.\n\n   ```.\n     940,833,598.\n   + 885,048,752.\n   -------------.\n   ```.\n\n2. **Add the digits starting from the rightmost digit (ones place):**.\n\n   - **Ones place:**  .\n     \\(8 + 2 = 10\\)  .\n     Write down **0** and carry over **1**.\n\n   - **Tens place:**  .\n     \\(9 + 5 = 14\\)  .\n     Add the carried-over **1:**  .\n     \\(14 + 1 = 15\\)  .\n     Write down **5** and carry over **1**.\n\n   - **Hundreds place:**  .\n     \\(3 + 7 = 10\\)  .\n     Add the carried-over **1:**  .\n     \\(10 + 1 = 11\\)  .\n     Write down **1** and carry over **1**.\n\n   - **Thousands place:**  .\n     \\(5 + 8 = 13\\)  .\n     Add the carried-over **1:**  .\n     \\(13 + 1 = 14\\)  .\n     Write down **4** and carry over **1**.\n\n   - **Ten thousands place:**  .\n     \\(8 + 4 = 12\\)  .\n     Add the carried-over **1:**  .\n     \\(12 + 1 = 13\\)  .\n     Write down **3** and carry over **1**.\n\n   - **Hundred thousands place:**  .\n     \\(0 + 0 = 0\\)  .\n     Add the carried-over **1:**  .\n     \\(0 + 1 = 1\\)  .\n     Write down **1**.\n\n   - **Millions place:**  .\n     \\(8 + 8 = 16\\)  .\n     Write down **6** and carry over **1**.\n\n   - **Ten millions place:**  .\n     \\(4 + 9 = 13\\)  .\n     Add the carried-over **1:**  .\n     \\(13 + 1 = 14\\)  .\n     Write down **4** and carry over **1**.\n\n   - **Hundred millions place:**  .\n     \\(9 + 8 = 17\\)  .\n     Add the carried-over **1:**  .\n     \\(17 + 1 = 18\\)  .\n     Write down **18**.\n\n3. **Combine all the results:**.\n\n   ```.\n     940,833,598.\n   + 885,048,752.\n   -------------.\n   1,825,982,350.\n   ```.\n\n# Answer:. Therefore, the answer is"]]
