**.\n   .\n   - **Tens place:** \\(9 + 7 + 1 = 17\\)  .\n     Write down **7** and carry over **1**.\n   .\n   - **Hundreds place:** \\(3 + 5 + 1 = 9\\)  .\n     Write down **9**.\n   .\n   - **Thousands place:** \\(1 + 8 = 9\\)  .\n     Write down **9**.\n   .\n   - **Ten thousands place:** \\(3 + 9 = 12\\)  .\n     Write down **2** and carry over **1**.\n   .\n   - **Hundred thousands place:** \\(6 + 1 + 1 = 8\\)  .\n     Write down **8**.\n   .\n   - **Millions place:** \\(5 + 2 = 7\\)  .\n     Write down **7**.\n   .\n   - **Ten millions place:** \\(3 + 3 = 6\\)  .\n     Write down **6**.\n   .\n   - **Hundred millions place:** \\(2 + 3 = 5\\)  .\n     Write down **5**.\n\n3. **Combine all the results:**.\n\n   \\[.\n   \\begin{array}{r}.\n     \\phantom{0}235,613,399 \\\\.\n   + 321,985,979 \\\\.\n   \\hline. Therefore, the answer is"]]
