illions place:** \\(5 + 3 + 1 = 9\\)\n   - **Ten-millions place:** \\(0 + 1 = 1\\)\n   - **Hundred-millions place:** \\(5 + 3 = 8\\)\n\n3. **Combine the results:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\begin{array}{r}\n     \\phantom{0}505,\\!840,\\!948 \\\\\n   + \\phantom{0}315,\\!185,\\!871 \\\\\n   \\hline\n     821,\\!026,\\!819 \\\\\n   \\end{array}\n   \\]\n\n# Answer:\nTherefore, the final computed sum is \\(\\boxed{821,\\!026,\\!819}\\).. Therefore, the answer is"]]
