 by their place values:**\n\n   ```\n     967,522,983\n   + 374,001,649\n   ---------------\n   ```\n\n2. **Add the digits starting from the rightmost digit (ones place) and move to the left, carrying over as needed:**\n\n   - **Ones place:**  \n     \\(3 + 9 = 12\\)  \n     Write down **2** and carry over **1**.\n\n   - **Tens place:**  \n     \\(8 + 4 + 1 = 13\\)  \n     Write down **3** and carry over **1**.\n\n   - **Hundreds place:**  \n     \\(9 + 1 + 1 = 11\\)  \n     Write down **1** and carry over **1**.\n\n   - **Thousands place:**  \n     \\(2 + 0 + 1 = 3\\)  \n     Write down **3**.\n\n   - **Ten thousands place:**  \n     \\(2 + 0 = 2\\)  \n     Write down **2**.\n\n   - **Hundred thousands place:**  \n     \\(5 + 4 = 9\\)  \n     Write down **9**.\n\n   - **Millions place:**  \n     \\(7 + 3 = 10\\)  \n     Write down **0** and carry over **1**.\n\n   - **Ten millions place:**  \n     \\(6 + 7 + 1 = 14\\)  \n     Write down **4** and carry over **1**.\n\n   - **Hundred millions place:**  \n     \\(9 + 3 + 1 = 13\\)  \n     Write down **3** and carry over **1**.\n\n   - **Billions place:**  \n     \\(1\\) (since there are no digits to add in this place)  \n     Write down **1**.\n\n3. **Combine all the written digits to get the final sum:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\boxed{1,\\!341,\\!524,\\!632}\n   \\]. Therefore, the answer is"]]
