   ```.\n     189,893,598.\n   + 249,385,574.\n   ---------------.\n   ```.\n\n2. **Add the digits starting from the ones place:**.\n\n   - **Ones place:**  .\n     \\(8 + 4 = 12\\)  .\n     Write down **2** and carry over **1** to the tens place.\n\n   - **Tens place:**  .\n     \\(9 + 7 = 16\\)  .\n     Add the carried-over **1:**  .\n     \\(16 + 1 = 17\\)  .\n     Write down **7** and carry over **1** to the hundreds place.\n\n   - **Hundreds place:**  .\n     \\(3 + 5 = 8\\)  .\n     Add the carried-over **1:**  .\n     \\(8 + 1 = 9\\)  .\n     Write down **9**.\n\n   - **Thousands place:**  .\n     \\(9 + 8 = 17\\)  .\n     Write down **7** and carry over **1** to the ten thousands place.\n\n   - **Ten thousands place:**  .\n     \\(8 + 3 = 11\\)  .\n     Add the carried-over **1:**  .\n     \\(11 + 1 = 12\\)  .\n     Write down **2** and carry over **1** to the hundred thousands place.\n\n   - **Hundred thousands place:**  .\n     \\(8 + 4 = 12\\)  .\n     Add the carried-over **1:**  .\n     \\(12 + 1 = 13\\)  .\n     Write down **3** and carry over **1** to the millions place.\n\n   - **Millions place:**  .\n     \\(9 + 2 = 11\\)  .\n     Add the carried-over **1:**  .\n     \\(11 + 1 = 12\\)  .\n     Write down **2** and carry over **1** to the ten millions place.\n\n   - **Ten millions place:**  .\n     \\(1 + 0 = 1\\)  .\n     Add the carried-over **1:**  .\n     \\(1 + 1 = 2\\)  .\n     Write down **2**.\n\n3. **Combine all the results:**.\n\n   ```.\n     189,893,598.\n   + 249,385,574.\n   ---------------. Therefore, the answer is"]]
